<title>NETHERLANDS: KRASNAPOLSKY POSTS SHARP PROFIT RISE.</title>
<headline>KRASNAPOLSKY POSTS SHARP PROFIT RISE.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	    22.15 vs   6.73</p>
<p>    Net profit			     5.25 vs   1.6</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  7.50 vs   2.50*</p>
<p>    Turnover				72.8  vs  56.6</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    10.9  vs   5.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Hotel and restaurant group Krasnapolsky NV previously</p>
<p>said it expected results to improve in 1996.</p>
<p>* besides the 2.50 guilders 1995 cash dividend, Krasnapolsky</p>
<p>also paid a bonus dividend that year of 5 new shrs per 100 held.</p>
</text>
